# The container images pkg-pages runs, pinned by digest. Sourced by the actions, never run.
# dev/check-action-pins.sh fails when a workflow or action names an image that is not listed here.
# Dependabot bumps action SHAs only, never these digests: update them by hand, in their own PR,
# and say so in its changelog entry (a new digest changes what every caller runs).
#
# FEDORA: rpmsign (rpm 6) for sign-rpm and the Fedora install test.
# DEBIAN: build-repo. Trixie's rpm 4.20 (Sequoia) reads a pin with revoked subkeys, which the
#         Ubuntu 24.04 runner's rpm 4.18 can't, and it has apt-ftparchive, createrepo-c and gh.
# UBUNTU: the Ubuntu install test.
DEBIAN_IMAGE=debian:trixie@sha256:4c25275446ca371766b8b093c696782eabce06263fccacb8d5d813b3dc44b308
UBUNTU_IMAGE=ubuntu:26.04@sha256:c098726dd9b9733f3e885f8de0ef375206a311b0a317eadc40d347b1115fb944
FEDORA_IMAGE=fedora:44@sha256:43b29f65a41eb9c35e1cd5323e3bdf3b655c2357a9f4f1ff2f9c2798e5045d80
